# 10 · Gur zbba rzbwv oebxr Naqebvq — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

`grkg[:178]` ybbxf yvxr "gur svefg 178 punenpgref". Vg vf "gur svefg 178 olgrf". Sbe NFPVV grkg
gur gjb ner gur fnzr, fb gur oht uvqrf guebhtu rirel grfg gung hfrf Ratyvfu grkg, hagvy n grkg
unf na `é`, n `·` be n 🌙 arne gur phg. Gura gur fyvpr raqf vafvqr n punenpgre, naq gur erfhyg vf
abg inyvq HGS-8 nal zber. Zbfg bs gur gvzr abguvat abgvprf. Gur olgrf geniry guebhtu Tb, guebhtu
WFBA, guebhtu gur chfu cebivqre, naq gur svefg cebtenz gung purpxf HGS-8 fgevpgyl vf ba n cubar
bs n phfgbzre, jurer vg penfurf.

Rirel yvzvg ba grkg vf n yvzvg va fbzr havg, naq gur havgf qvssre cre flfgrz:

- **olgrf:** chfu cnlybnqf, UGGC urnqref, qngnonfr pbyhzaf va ZlFDY'f `INEOVANEL`, n Xnsxn zrffntr,
  gur 178-olgr cerivrj svryq;
- **eharf** (Havpbqr pbqr cbvagf): CbfgterFDY'f `inepune(a)`, Clguba'f `yra`, zbfg "punenpgref"
  va n fcrp;
- **HGS-16 pbqr havgf:** Wnin naq WninFpevcg fgevat yratguf, gur pbyhza va gur Ynathntr Freire
  Cebgbpby;
- **jung n crefba frrf** (tencurzr pyhfgref): `é` jevggra nf `r` cyhf na npprag, 👍🏽, n synt.

Gur oht vf arire "Tb tbg vg jebat". Vg vf n yvzvg jubfr havg abobql jebgr qbja. Gur svefg wbo vf gb
qrpvqr, sbe rnpu yvzvg, juvpu havg vg pbhagf. Gur frpbaq wbo vf gb phg bayl jurer n punenpgre
raqf, va gung havg.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Anzr gur havg bs rirel ahzore.** Jevgr vg arkg gb rnpu cnenzrgre orsber lbh pbqr: `yvzvg` va
`GehapngrOlgrf` vf olgrf, `yvzvg` va `GehapngrEharf` vf eharf, `bssfrg` va `Cbfvgvba` vf olgrf, gur
pbyhza vg ergheaf vf eharf. Unys bs gur ohtf va grkg pbqr ner n ahzore va 1 havg hfrq nf n ahzore
va nabgure havg, fhpu nf n ehar pbhag cnffrq gb `f[:a]`.

**2. Qenj gur fgevat nf olgrf.** Gnxr `"byé 🌙"`, jevgr rnpu olgr jvgu vgf vaqrk, naq znex jurer
rnpu ehar fgnegf. Rirel dhrfgvba va guvf rkrepvfr vf n dhrfgvba nobhg gubfr znexf. "Phg gb 5
olgrf" vf "gur ynfg znex ng be orsber 5". "Vf bssfrg 4 inyvq?" vf "vf 4 n znex?". Bapr lbh frr
gur znexf, gur pbqr vf n jnyx sebz znex gb znex.

**3. Qrpvqr jung unccraf gb onq vachg orsber lbh zrrg vg.** Grkg sebz gur bhgfvqr vf abg nyjnlf
inyvq HGS-8: n svezjner gung phg n fgevat va P, n svyr va Yngva-1, n grkg gung jnf nyernql phg
bapr, nf va gur vapvqrag. Lbh unir 3 pubvprf: erwrpg vg, ercnve vg, be cnff vg guebhtu. Guvf
rkrepvfr qbrf 2 bs gurz ba checbfr: gur gehapngr shapgvbaf cnff vainyvq olgrf guebhtu hapunatrq
(gurl phg, gurl qb abg whqtr), naq `Pyrna` ercnvef. N cebqhpgvba cvcryvar hfhnyyl ehaf gur
ercnve svefg, ng gur rqtr jurer grkg ragref gur flfgrz, naq gura rirelguvat nsgre vg pna nffhzr
inyvq HGS-8.

**4. Grfg gur obhaqnevrf jvgu zhygv-olgr grkg.** N gehapngr shapgvba gung jbexf sbe `"nopqrstu"`
cebirf abguvat. Zbir gur yvzvg npebff n 2-olgr ehar naq n 4-olgr ehar, 1 olgr ng n gvzr, naq
jevgr gur rkcrpgrq erfhyg sbe rirel fgrc. Gung gnoyr vf gur grfg `GrfgGehapngrOlgrfRirelPhg`.
N shmm grfg gura purpxf gur cebcregvrf sbe vachgf lbh qvq abg guvax bs.

## Pbaprcgf

### N fgevat vf n ebj bs olgrf

Va Tb n `fgevat` vf na vzzhgnoyr fyvpr bs olgrf. `yra(f)` vf gur ahzore bs olgrf, `f[v]` vf n
`olgr`, naq `f[v:w]` phgf ng olgr bssfrgf. Abguvat va gur glcr fnlf gung gur olgrf ner HGS-8; Tb
fbhepr svyrf ner HGS-8, fb fgevat yvgrenyf hfhnyyl ner, ohg n fgevat pna ubyq nal olgrf.

`f[v:w]` qbrf abg pbcl: gur erfhyg funerf gur olgrf bs `f`, gur fnzr jnl 2 fyvprf funerq n onpxvat
neenl va 04. Gung vf jul phggvat vf purnc. Vg nyfb zrnaf gung n fubeg fhofgevat xrrcf gur jubyr
ybat fgevat nyvir va zrzbel. Sbe n chfu grkg gung qbrf abg znggre; sbe n 10-olgr VQ phg sebz n
1 ZO erfcbafr gung lbh xrrc va n znc, `fgevatf.Pybar` znxrf n pbcl bs vgf bja.

### HGS-8 va 1 gnoyr

HGS-8 rapbqrf rnpu pbqr cbvag va 1 gb 4 olgrf. Gur svefg olgr fnlf ubj znal sbyybj:

| Pbqr cbvagf | Olgrf | Svefg olgr | Rknzcyr |
|---|---|---|---|
| H+0000 gb H+007S | 1 | `0kkkkkkk` | `n` = `61` |
| H+0080 gb H+07SS | 2 | `110kkkkk` | `é` = `p3 n9` |
| H+0800 gb H+SSSS | 3 | `1110kkkk` | `…` = `r2 80 n6` |
| H+10000 gb H+10SSSS | 4 | `11110kkk` | `🌙` = `s0 9s 8p 99` |

Rirel olgr nsgre gur svefg unf gur sbez `10kkkkkk`, n pbagvahngvba olgr. 2 pbafrdhraprf znggre
urer. NFPVV olgrf arire nccrne vafvqr n zhygv-olgr ehar, fb frnepuvat sbe `\a` be n fcnpr olgr ol
olgr vf fnsr. Naq va inyvq grkg, n phg vf fnsr rknpgyl jura gur arkg olgr vf abg n pbagvahngvba
olgr, juvpu vf jung `hgs8.EharFgneg` purpxf.

### Eharf, naq sbe enatr bire n fgevat

N `ehar` vf na `vag32` gung ubyqf 1 pbqr cbvag. N `sbe enatr` ybbc bire n fgevat qrpbqrf vg:

```tb
sbe v, e := enatr "byé" {
	szg.Cevagya(v, fgevat(e)) // 0 b, 1 y, 2 é
}
```

`v` vf gur olgr vaqrk jurer gur ehar fgnegf, fb vg whzcf sebz 2 gb 4 nsgre `é`. Gurfr vaqrkrf ner
rknpgyl gur znexf sebz "Ubj gb nccebnpu vg". Jura gur ybbc zrrgf n olgr gung vf abg inyvq HGS-8,
vg lvryqf `hgs8.EharReebe` (H+SSSQ) naq zbirf ba ol 1 olgr. Gung vf jurer gur ehyr "na vainyvq
olgr vf n ehar bs 1 olgr" pbzrf sebz: vg vf ubj Tb vgfrys jnyxf n fgevat, naq
`hgs8.EharPbhagVaFgevat` pbhagf gur fnzr jnl.

`hgs8.QrpbqrEharVaFgevat(f)` qbrf 1 fgrc bs gung ybbc ol unaq: vg ergheaf gur svefg ehar naq vgf
fvmr va olgrf. Lbh arrq vg jura gur ybbc zhfg fgbc ng n olgr ohqtrg be fgneg va gur zvqqyr bs n
fgevat. Vgf fvmr vf gur ubarfg jvqgu: 1 sbe na vainyvq olgr. `hgs8.EharYra(e)` nafjref n
qvssrerag dhrfgvba, "ubj znal olgrf jbhyq guvf ehar arrq vs V rapbqrq vg?", naq sbe
`hgs8.EharReebe` gur nafjre vf 3. Hfr gur fvmr gur qrpbqre tvirf lbh, abg gur fvmr bs gur ehar vg
ercbegf.

### []ehar vf n pbairefvba, abg n ivrj

`[]ehar(f)` qrpbqrf gur jubyr fgevat vagb n arj fyvpr bs eharf, naq `fgevat(eharf)` rapbqrf vg
ntnva. Vg vf gur boivbhf jnl gb "pbhag punenpgref", naq vg unf 2 pbfgf. Vg nyybpngrf 4 olgrf cre
ehar. Naq vg vf ybffl sbe vainyvq vachg: rirel vainyvq olgr orpbzrf H+SSSQ, juvpu rapbqrf nf 3
olgrf, fb `fgevat([]ehar(f))` vf abg nyjnlf `f`. Sbe `GehapngrEharf` ba inyvq grkg vg jbexf; sbe
`GehapngrOlgrf` vg punatrf gur olgrf gung gur ehyrf fnl gb xrrc.

### Ercnvevat grkg

Gurer ner 2 pbzzba jnlf gb ercnve vainyvq HGS-8, naq cebqhpgvba pbqr hfrf obgu:

- ercynpr **rnpu vainyvq olgr** jvgu H+SSSQ: jung `sbe enatr`, `[]ehar(f)` naq
  `rapbqvat/wfba`'f `Znefuny` qb;
- ercynpr **rnpu eha** bs vainyvq olgrf jvgu 1 H+SSSQ (be nabgure fgevat): jung
  `fgevatf.GbInyvqHGS8` qbrf. N phg rzbwv gura fubjf nf 1 `�`, abg 3.

`Pyrna` hfrf ehaf. Gur qrgnvy gb trg evtug vf gung H+SSSQ vf nyfb n abezny, inyvq ehar. Fbzrbar
znl unir cnfgrq `�` vagb n pyhfgre anzr, naq gung vf grkg, abg na reebe. Gur qrpbqre ergheaf gur
fnzr ehar sbe obgu pnfrf; bayl gur fvmr (3 sbe n erny H+SSSQ, 1 sbe na vainyvq olgr) gryyf gurz
ncneg.

Pbageby punenpgref ner gur bgure unys bs pyrnavat. N AHY olgr raqf gur fgevat va P pbqr ba gur
cubar, na RFP fgnegf n grezvany rfpncr frdhrapr va n ybt ivrjre, naq n `\e` znxrf n ybt yvar
birejevgr vgfrys. Gno naq arjyvar ner xrcg orpnhfr n chfu obql znl hfr gurz. Gur Tb shapgvba
`havpbqr.VfPbageby` vf abg dhvgr guvf ehyr: vg nyfb zngpurf gur P1 enatr H+0080 gb H+009S. Jevgr
gur ehyr lbh jrer tvira, abg gur arnerfg yvoenel shapgvba, naq fnl va n pbzzrag jul.

### fgevatf.Ohvyqre

Ohvyqvat n fgevat jvgu `+=` va n ybbc pbcvrf gur jubyr fgevat ng rirel fgrc. `fgevatf.Ohvyqre`
nccraqf gb na vagreany olgr fyvpr naq gheaf vg vagb n fgevat bapr, jvgubhg n pbcl, jura lbh pnyy
`Fgevat()`. `JevgrEhar` rapbqrf n ehar nf HGS-8; `JevgrFgevat` naq `JevgrOlgr` nccraq olgrf.
`Tebj(a)` erfreirf ebbz hc sebag jura lbh xabj ebhtuyl ubj ovt gur erfhyg vf, juvpu sbe `Pyrna`
vf nobhg `yra(f)`. 26-ybtszg ohvyqf rirel harfpncrq inyhr guvf jnl.

### Jung n crefba pnyyf n punenpgre

`é` pna or 1 ehar (H+00R9) be 2 (`r` cyhf gur pbzovavat npprag H+0301). Gurl ybbx gur fnzr, gurl
ner qvssrerag fgevatf, naq `GehapngrEharf` znl phg orgjrra gur `r` naq vgf npprag. N guhzof hc
jvgu n fxva gbar vf 2 eharf, n snzvyl rzbwv pna or 7, n synt vf 2 ertvbany vaqvpngbef. Jung n
crefba frrf nf 1 punenpgre vf n tencurzr pyhfgre. Gur fgnaqneq yvoenel unf ab tencurzr fhccbeg.
`tbynat.bet/k/grkg/havpbqr/abez` gheaf gur 2-ehar `é` vagb gur 1-ehar sbez (ASP) sbe gur pbzzba
nppragf, naq `tvguho.pbz/evib/havfrt` fcyvgf grkg vagb tencurzr pyhfgref. Guvf rkrepvfr pbhagf
eharf naq fnlf fb; gur fgergpu tbny tbrf shegure.

### Sebz olgr bssfrg gb yvar naq pbyhza

Cnefref naq qrpbqref ercbeg reebef nf olgr bssfrgf, orpnhfr olgrf ner jung gurl ernq:
`wfba.FlagnkReebe.Bssfrg`, gur cbfvgvba va gur vapvqrag'f penfu ybt, gur `Pby` bs 26-ybtszg'f
`FlagnkReebe`. Crbcyr ernq yvarf naq pbyhzaf va na rqvgbe. Gur pbairefvba vf n jnyx sebz gur
fgneg: pbhag `\a` sbe gur yvar, naq pbhag eharf fvapr gur ynfg `\a` sbe gur pbyhza. Gur jnyx nyfb
gryyf lbh jurgure gur bssfrg vf n erny ehar fgneg: vs n fgrc whzcf bire vg, gur bssfrg cbvagrq
vagb gur zvqqyr bs n ehar.

Juvpu pbyhza havg gb hfr qrcraqf ba gur ernqre. Gur Tb pbzcvyre ercbegf olgr pbyhzaf
(`tb/gbxra.Cbfvgvba.Pbyhza` vf n olgr pbhag), naq fb qbrf 26-ybtszg. Rqvgbef gung fcrnx gur
Ynathntr Freire Cebgbpby pbhag HGS-16 pbqr havgf ol qrsnhyg (🌙 vf 2 gurer), naq fvapr irefvba
3.17 n pyvrag naq n freire pna nterr ba HGS-8 be HGS-32 vafgrnq. Guvf rkrepvfr pbhagf eharf,
juvpu vf jung zbfg crbcyr zrna ol "pbyhza 43".

## Cvgsnyyf

- **`f[:a]` jvgu n ehar pbhag**, be n olgr yvzvg nccyvrq jvgu `[]ehar`: gur havg bs gur ahzore naq
  gur havg bs gur phg qvssre.
- **`hgs8.EharYra(e)` nf gur jvqgu**: vg fnlf 3 sbe na vainyvq olgr, fb gur ohqtrg vf jebat nf
  fbba nf gur grkg unf 1 vainyvq olgr.
- **`fgevat([]ehar(f)[:a])` va `GehapngrOlgrf`**: vg punatrf vainyvq olgrf vagb H+SSSQ, naq gur
  erfhyg pna tebj cnfg gur yvzvg.
- **Sbetrggvat gur ebbz sbe gur ryyvcfvf**: phggvat gb `yvzvg` olgrf naq gura nqqvat `…` tvirf
  `yvzvg + 3` olgrf, juvpu vf gur oht gur cerivrj svryq jnf zrnag gb cerirag.
- **Gerngvat rirel `hgs8.EharReebe` nf vainyvq** va `Pyrna`: n erny H+SSSQ va gur vachg gura wbvaf
  n eha be trgf ercynprq.
- **Pyrnavat va gur jebat beqre**: fgevccvat pbageby punenpgref svefg naq ercnvevat frpbaq wbvaf
  2 ehaf gung n AHY frcnengrq. Svaq gur ehaf va gur vachg.
- **`havpbqr.VfPbageby`** sbe gur pbageby grfg: vg nyfb erzbirf H+0080 gb H+009S naq qbrf abg
  fcner gno naq arjyvar.
- **Qrpbqvat `f[:bssfrg]` va `Cbfvgvba`**: unys n ehar ng gur raq qrpbqrf nf vainyvq olgrf, naq na
  bssfrg vafvqr n ehar trgf n pbyhza vafgrnq bs `snyfr`.
- **Grfgvat bayl NFPVV**: rirel shapgvba va guvf rkrepvfr vf pbeerpg sbe NFPVV va vgf svefg,
  jebat irefvba.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Chfu freivprf** yvzvg cnlybnqf va olgrf: Nccyr'f NCAf npprcgf 4 XO sbe n abezny abgvsvpngvba,
  naq Sveronfr Pybhq Zrffntvat npprcgf 4096 olgrf bs cnlybnq. N cerivrj be n gvgyr svryq vf bsgra
  fubegre, naq gur cebivqre be gur ncc znl phg vg ntnva. Gehapngr ba ehar obhaqnevrf orsber lbh
  fraq, jvgu ebbz sbe lbhe bja ryyvcfvf, fb gung abobql qbjafgernz unf gb phg sbe lbh.
- **FZF** pbhagf va n qvssrerag havg ntnva: 160 punenpgref va gur TFZ 7-ovg nycunorg, ohg 1 rzbwv
  fjvgpurf gur jubyr zrffntr gb HPF-2, jurer gur yvzvg vf 70 havgf naq 🌙 gnxrf 2 bs gurz.
- **Qngnonfrf.** CbfgterFDY erwrpgf vainyvq vachg jvgu
  `vainyvq olgr frdhrapr sbe rapbqvat "HGS8": 0ks0 0k9s 0k8p`, naq vgf `inepune(a)` pbhagf
  punenpgref, abg olgrf. ZlFDY'f byq `hgs8` punefrg (`hgs8zo3`) fgberf ng zbfg 3 olgrf cre
  punenpgre, fb rirel rzbwv snvyf jvgu `Vapbeerpg fgevat inyhr` hagvy gur pbyhza vf `hgs8zo4`.
- **Frevnyvmngvba.** `rapbqvat/wfba` ercynprf rnpu vainyvq olgr jvgu H+SSSQ jura vg znefunyf, fb
  gur WFBA vf inyvq ohg gur grkg punatrq. Gur Tb cebgbohs yvoenel ershfrf gb znefuny n cebgb3
  `fgevat` svryq gung vf abg inyvq HGS-8, fb n tECP pnyy snvyf vafgrnq. Obgu ner ernfbaf gb pyrna
  ng gur rqtr.
- **Naqebvq.** Angvir pbqr gung unaqf olgrf gb gur WIZ guebhtu WAV'f `ArjFgevatHGS` zhfg cnff
  Zbqvsvrq HGS-8, naq jvgu PurpxWAV ranoyrq na vainyvq olgr nobegf gur ncc jvgu
  `WAV QRGRPGRQ REEBE VA NCCYVPNGVBA`. Gung vf 1 jnl n phg rzbwv orpbzrf "Irfcre Ynof unf
  fgbccrq".
- **Xhoreargrf** ynory inyhrf ner ng zbfg 63 punenpgref sebz n fznyy NFPVV frg, fb gurer olgrf naq
  punenpgref nterr. Naabgngvbaf nyybj nal HGS-8 ohg yvzvg gur gbgny fvmr va olgrf. Ernq gur havg
  va rnpu fcrp.
- **Reebe cbfvgvbaf.** Gbbyf gung cevag `svyr:yvar:pby` zhfg fnl juvpu pbyhza havg gurl hfr. Tb'f
  pbzcvyre hfrf olgrf, YFC rqvgbef hfr HGS-16 ol qrsnhyg, naq gur zvfzngpu vf jul na rqvgbe
  fbzrgvzrf haqreyvarf gur jebat punenpgre ba n yvar jvgu na rzbwv.

## Jurer guvf pbzrf onpx

Lbh hfrq `fgevatf` ba NFPVV grkg va 01 naq 05; guvf rkrepvfr vf jurer gur olgrf haqre gubfr
shapgvbaf orpbzr ivfvoyr. 18 cnqf gnoyr pbyhzaf, naq gur jvqgu bs n pbyhza vf n ehar pbhag, abg
`yra`. 24 naq 25 ercbeg reebef ng olgr pbyhzaf bs n yvar, naq 26-ybtszg fgngrf gur ehyr bapr zber:
vgf `Pby` pbhagf olgrf, fb `é` vf 2 pbyhzaf. 26 nyfb unf n shmm grfg, `ShmmCnefr`, ohvyg yvxr
`ShmmGehapngr`: cebcregvrf vafgrnq bs rknzcyrf, frrqf gung eha va rirel cynva `tb grfg`. 42 rfpncrf
ynory inyhrf sbe gur Cebzrgurhf grkg sbezng, jurer vainyvq HGS-8 naq pbageby punenpgref pbzr onpx.

